\n        \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n        Performs the matrix multiplication.\\n\\n        Args:\\n            A (torch.Tensor): Input matrix A of shape (N, N).\\n            B (torch.Tensor): Input matrix B of shape (N, N).\\n\\n        Returns:\\n            torch.Tensor: Output matrix C of shape (N, N).\\n        \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n        return torch.matmul(A, B)\\n\\nN = 2048 * 2\\n\\ndef get_inputs():\\n    A = torch.rand(N, N)\\n    B = torch.rand(N, N)\\n    return [A, B]\\n\\ndef get_init_inputs():\\n    return []  # No special initialization inputs needed\\n```\\n\\nTarget data type requirement:\\n- Primary compute dtype must be BF16 (`torch.bfloat16`).\\n- Generated HIP/ROCm code should implement the BF16 path directly, not by silently switching main math to FP32.\\n\\nOptimize the architecture named Model with custom HIP/ROCm operators! Name your optimized\\noutput architecture ModelNew. Output the new code in codeblocks. Please generate real\\ncode, NOT pseudocode, make sure the code compiles and is fully functional. Just output\\nthe new model code, no other text, and NO testing code!\\n\",\"max_output_tokens\":16384,\"model\":\"gpt-5.3-codex\",\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"high\"}}"}}, "request_meta": {"model": "gpt-5.3-codex", "max_output_tokens": 16384, "reasoning": {"effort": "high"}}, "response": {"http_version": "HTTP/1.1", "headers": [["Date", "Thu, 12 Mar 2026 05:51:27 GMT"], ["Content-Type", "application/json"], ["Transfer-Encoding", "chunked"], ["Connection", "keep-alive"], ["Server", "cloudflare"], ["x-ratelimit-limit-requests", "15000"], ["x-ratelimit-limit-tokens", "40000000"], ["x-ratelimit-remaining-requests", "14999"], ["x-ratelimit-remaining-tokens", "39992872"], ["x-ratelimit-reset-requests", "4ms"], ["x-ratelimit-reset-tokens", "10ms"], ["openai-version", "2020-10-01"], ["openai-organization", "user-gkecbvpi5qhvhyambwxpr8fh"], ["openai-project", "proj_EkbW0zlnFODIW5wl4jG2vWR3"], ["x-request-id", "req_716fa760fa6446c3a7ddebd258347be7"], ["openai-pr